{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2019-10-31 22:30:00', 'title': 'AT&T INC. ANNOUNCES APPOINTMENT OF STEPHEN LUCZO TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS AND CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT AND FINANCE COMMITTEE', 'text': 'AT&T INC. ANNOUNCED THAT STEPHEN LUCZO HAS BEEN ELECTED TO THE COMPANY’S BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY. MR. LUCZO IS CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD OF SEAGATE TECHNOLOGY AND HAS SERVED IN THIS ROLE SINCE 2002. FROM OCTOBER 2017 TO OCTOBER 2018, HE ALSO SERVED AS EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN. BEFORE THAT, HE SERVED TWO TENURES AS CEO AND CHAIRMAN. MR. LUCZO’S ELECTION BRINGS THE NUMBER OF SEATS ON THE AT&T BOARD OF DIRECTORS TO 14. HE WILL SERVE ON THE BOARD’S CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT AND FINANCE COMMITTEE. STEPHEN LUCZO HAS SERVED AS SEAGATE TECHNOLOGY’S CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD SINCE 2002. FROM OCTOBER 2017 TO OCTOBER 2018, HE ALSO SERVED AS EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN. BEFORE THAT, HE SERVED TWO TENURES AS THE COMPANY’S CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND CHAIRMAN.'}